  "title": "Babcock & Wilcox Enterprises Announces Pricing of Common Stock Offering",
  "summary": "Babcock &amp; Wilcox Enterprises, Inc. announced that it priced an underwritten public offering of 10,810,811 shares of its common stock at a price to the public of $18.50 per share (the “Offering”), for gross proceeds of approximately $200 million, before deducting underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses payable by the Company.",
